    "q": "Key points: <b>Nucleus and protein factory</b>",
    "a": "• Nucleus: DNA, double envelope with pores, <b>nucleolus</b> makes ribosomes.<br>• Rough ER (ribosomes) → Golgi (modify, sort, package) → vesicles → membrane.<br>• Smooth ER: lipids, detoxification, calcium store."
