    "q": "Key points: <b>Energy and recycling</b>",
    "a": "• <b>Mitochondria</b>: respiration, ATP, cristae, own DNA. <b>Chloroplasts</b>: photosynthesis, thylakoids, own DNA.<br>• <b>Lysosomes</b>: digestion. <b>Peroxisomes</b>: break down H<sub>2</sub>O<sub>2</sub> with catalase.<br>• Plant central vacuole: water store, <b>turgor</b>."
