    "id": "bio12-018",
    "t": "recall",
    "q": "<small>Electron carriers</small><br><b>NADP</b><br><i>Oxidised form · Reduced form · Where it works?</i>",
    "a": "<b>Oxidised form:</b> NADP<sup>+</sup><br><b>Reduced form:</b> <b>NADPH</b><br><b>Where it works:</b> Photosynthesis (carries electrons to make sugar)"
