    "q": "Snapdragon flower colour shows incomplete dominance: red (RR) × white (rr) gives pink (Rr). A pink plant is crossed with a white plant. What are the expected offspring?<br><br><br>A) 1/2 pink and 1/2 white<br>B) All pink<br>C) 1/2 red and 1/2 white<br>D) 1 red : 2 pink : 1 white<br>E) 3/4 pink and 1/4 white",
