    "q": "A stretch of chromatin has 10 nucleosomes. Each nucleosome has 147 bp of DNA wrapped around the histone core, and each is separated by 53 bp of linker DNA. What is the total length of DNA (counting 10 repeats of core + linker)?<br><br><br>A) 1470 bp<br>B) 2000 bp<br>C) 530 bp<br>D) 2200 bp<br>E) 1000 bp",
