    "t": "summary",
    "q": "Key points: <b>Muscle</b>",
    "a": "• <b>Skeletal</b> (striated, voluntary, many nuclei), <b>cardiac</b> (striated, branched, intercalated discs), <b>smooth</b> (non-striated, involuntary)."
