    "a": "<b>B) Pulmonary artery, lungs, pulmonary vein, left atrium, left ventricle</b><br><br>Right ventricle → pulmonary artery → capillaries in the lungs → pulmonary vein → left atrium → left ventricle → aorta. This is the pulmonary circuit followed by the systemic circuit (double circulation)."
